# Proposal for ODP-002: state in OWL BFO's rule that a specifically
# dependent continuant has exactly one bearer. Declaring 'inheres in'
# functional is faithful to BFO 2020 (ISO 21838-2) and catches roles,
# and Option-A positions, that are wrongly given two bearers.
@prefix obo: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/lof/odp-002/proposals/functional-inherence> a owl:Ontology .
obo:BFO_0000197 a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
